-    - **Update**: Update `distances` by adding the sampled SDF value $d$: $distances \leftarrow distances + d$ [S1, unofficial].
-    - **Recalculate Positions**: Update positions: $p \leftarrow ro + distances \cdot v$ [S1, unofficial].
